hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2933","###\n Narrated to us by Al-Abbas ibn al-Jabbar, who said: Narrated to us Sufyan, from Abdur-Rahman ibn al-Qasim, from his father, who said: I heard Aisha (RA) say, while spreading her hands: \"I perfumed the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) with these two hands of mine for his Ihram when he entered the state of Ihram, and for his Halq (exiting Ihram) before he performed the Tawaf of the House.\""
"2934","Narrated to us Ahmad ibn 'Abdah, who informed us that Hammad ibn Zayd said: And narrated to us Ahmad ibn al-Miqdam, who narrated to us Hammad, on the authority of 'Amr ibn Dinar, on the authority of Salim ibn 'Abdullah, on the authority of 'A'ishah (RA), who said: \"I applied perfume to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) at Mina before he visited the House (performed Tawaf).\""
